please refer to the Terms and Conditions for the Adoption Assistance program
below.</font><o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0cm;"><span class="MsoHyperlink"><span style="line-height: 107%;"><span style="color: rgb(47, 85, 151);"><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/adoption_assistance_program"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Adoption Assistance on Premier</font></a></span></span></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" color="#3333ff">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Please refer to the Terms and Conditions and
