Resources on Premier</a></span><o:p></o:p></font></span></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span class="cf01" style="">While we do not provide claim pre‐approvals
or Educational Assistance claim reimbursement guarantees, the following are
some parameters to determine if a course is eligible.</span></font></p><ul style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><li style="box-sizing: border-box; list-style: inherit;">The course/seminar/conference/exam must be job-related for continuing education. In addition, you must provide proof of successful completion, proof of payment, and a description to be eligible for the reimbursement (up to $1,500 per calendar year).</li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; list-style: inherit;">For a degree program, you must provide proof of successful completion, proof of payment, proof of degree enrollment, and a breakdown of tuition vs. fees to be eligible for the reimbursement (up to $1,500 per calendar year). The maximum benefit you may receive for courses completed in one calendar year is $1,500.</li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; list-style: inherit;">License renewal, certifications, and memberships are eligible upon course completion. We do not reimburse for subscriptions or memberships alone. However, you may re-submit a claim with a course taken and completed under the membership.</li></ul><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in;"><span class="cf01"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">If you still have questions or your email requires an immediate
answer, please reach out to the Insperity Contact Center, using the Case Number
in the subject line above,&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">at 866-715-3552 (select Option1: Benefits) on weekdays between
7:00 a.m. and 7:00 p.m. Central Time.</span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in;"><span class="cf01"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in;"><span class="cf01"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you
